{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15340010","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15340010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1534001001:1":{"text":"シャウラと共に、ゴールデンサーペントが現れるのを待ってんだよ。","source_cn":"俺跟烈声在这里等金鳞蛇皇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x724B77887B96A081","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1534001002:1":{"text":"狩猟神の力で変身したなら、その身体には神の力が残留してるはずだ。","source_cn":"既然这种鱼是被狩猎神变化的，身上肯定残留着狩猎神的神力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE565FE8D2F52EBAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1534001003:1":{"text":"奴らはいずれ村を襲ってくる。だから、それまでに殲滅しなきゃなんねえべ！","source_cn":"它们迟早会袭击村落，俺们必须在那之前彻底消灭它们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CEA599DEC4A82A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1534001004:1":{"text":"グダグダ言ってんじゃねえよ！さっさと来て、網を張るのを手伝え！","source_cn":"能不能别废话了？快过来帮我一起放渔网！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E85C3EBC789AC99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:坚锤":{"text":"ハイハン","source":"坚锤","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:烈声":{"text":"シャウラ","source":"烈声","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}